WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.639
So, I want to talk about the 10-minute

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:04.880
drill, which is super tactical. But

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:07.120
first, like the most visited page on my

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.679
website, sweatystart.com, of all time,

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:12.480
is my 200 plus business ideas that are

00:00:09.679 --> 00:00:15.040
all boring, all bootstrappable, and none

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:16.720
of them are sexy. So, like just looking

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.480
at that list and just thinking about

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:21.520
them in your town is a really good way

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:23.920
to start. You go to sweatystart.com/idas

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:25.359
to get the list and look at it. Like,

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.880
that's step one. Now, the 10-minute

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:30.560
drill is a core, you know, section of

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.399
the book that I think is super powerful.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:34.160
Buddy of mine calls me up, says, "Nick,

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:35.600
I got a business idea. I want to I want

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.880
to come over and talk about it." I'm

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.280
like, "Okay, let's let's drink some

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.480
beer." Saturday, Sunday afternoon, we're

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.600
sitting on my back deck. He's like, "All

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.280
right, Nick, I want to start a painting

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.040
company, house painting company, or I

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.640
want to buy a franchise. I've, you know,

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:47.680
shopped out these three franchises. I've

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:49.680
looked at potentially buying this

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:52.399
business over here. You know, I actually

00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:54.559
bought a web domain. I built a a basic

00:00:52.399 --> 00:00:56.640
website on WordPress. I got my logo on

00:00:54.559 --> 00:00:58.239
99 Designs and he had done months and

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.559
months of work to potentially start a

00:00:58.239 --> 00:01:01.440
house painting business in this town.

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:04.400
And he's like, "What do you think,

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:06.960
Nick?" And I go, "It doesn't matter what

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:08.400
I think." And he's like, "What do you

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.159
mean?" And I said, "It doesn't matter

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:12.479
what I think about the business. Let's

00:01:10.159 --> 00:01:13.760
just figure out a little bit about the

00:01:12.479 --> 00:01:16.240
competition." So, I pull up my phone. I

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.080
type in house painting and on Google

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:20.560
Maps and 10 house painting companies in

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:22.640
Athens pop up. There's many more. I hit

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:24.880
the one nearest me and I called him.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:26.080
Second ring, the guy answers, says, "Oh,

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.360
yeah. You know, I can be out there

00:01:26.080 --> 00:01:29.439
tomorrow morning to give you a quote.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:30.720
I've done these big jobs. I got a crew

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:32.799
ready on Wednesday, actually. Like,

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.640
we're we're looking for some work." I

00:01:32.799 --> 00:01:37.759
say, "Okay, thanks." Hang up. Call the

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:39.040
next guy. He says, "Man, like I'm

00:01:37.759 --> 00:01:42.079
looking at your house on Google Maps

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:44.159
right now. This is a This job's $3,200.

00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:45.439
I'll use the best paint and I got a crew

00:01:44.159 --> 00:01:47.439
that can start. It can be out there

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:49.520
tomorrow morning." This is Sunday

00:01:47.439 --> 00:01:51.119
afternoon. Brian,

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:53.200
shut down the phone. Call another Call

00:01:51.119 --> 00:01:54.880
another guy. Third guy answers the phone

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:56.720
and the second ring and he says he'll

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:59.280
price match anybody and he's also got a

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.119
c a crew available to paint my house

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:02.560
this week.

00:02:01.119 --> 00:02:03.920
I hang up the phone and I look at my

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.761
friend. I was like, "All right, what is

00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:06.719
what do you think about the market?"

00:02:05.761 --> 00:02:08.640
[laughter]

00:02:06.719 --> 00:02:10.080
And he's like, "Damn, I don't really

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:13.280
want to compete against all those very

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.480
hungry operators eager to win business."

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:16.319
And then you go to the other side of

00:02:14.480 --> 00:02:18.480
that. I needed a survey done on a piece

00:02:16.319 --> 00:02:21.920
of property I bought here in Athens. I

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:24.160
called 10 people to do this survey.

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:26.239
One answered the phone and I called back

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.160
several because I needed two quotes. I

00:02:26.239 --> 00:02:30.160
could not get a second quote. Paid this

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:31.520
guy, 1800 bucks for 4 hours of work to

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:34.520
come out to my house to mark my property

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:34.520
lines.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:40.160
>> Insane. [laughter]

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:42.000
Not every not every single one of these

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:43.440
businesses is a phenomenal opportunity.

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.120
But when you're doing a sweaty startup,

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:50.480
you have something that's a massive

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:53.360
advantage, and that is a geography mode.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:55.120
You have a moat that is physical in your

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:57.680
town because a human being has to show

00:02:55.120 --> 00:03:02.080
up to do work on your site or on your

00:02:57.680 --> 00:03:03.680
property. So you can study the market.

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.040
You can say, "Okay, house painting is a

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:06.959
really good business in Boston, for

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.599
example. Maybe it's really bad business

00:03:06.959 --> 00:03:11.760
in Athens. I know that." And so on. So

00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:14.159
you can build your list of businesses.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:16.480
You can call the competition and you can

00:03:14.159 --> 00:03:18.480
actually figure out very quickly where

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:21.040
the opportunity might be. But everybody

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:22.159
wants to analyze and analyze and analyze

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.080
and analyze.

00:03:22.159 --> 00:03:26.400
>> I think that's a I think that's a super

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:28.400
smart way of going about it of literally

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:30.000
just calling your local competition and

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:31.519
just saying like, hey, what's going on?

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.799
And actually to your point, like that's

00:03:31.519 --> 00:03:35.760
something I never thought about, which

00:03:32.799 --> 00:03:38.080
is literally, hey, okay, all of these

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:40.319
people are immediately available and

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:42.560
ready to operate. Demand may not be that

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:44.640
high right now. If we got way more

00:03:42.560 --> 00:03:46.319
supply than we have demand, is this a is

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:48.640
this a company that I want to start in

00:03:46.319 --> 00:03:50.080
today's market? Maybe not. So, to your

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:52.480
point, it's whatever industry that

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:55.200
you're thinking of pursuing. Yeah. Just

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:57.200
dial just dial 10 companies in there and

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.159
see if see if they're backed up. That's

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.720
freaking genius.

00:03:58.159 --> 00:04:00.000
>> Yeah.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.599
>> That's so stupid simple.

