>> Then there's a tree company in Athens

00:04:01.599 --> 00:04:05.840
where you know you can call four or five

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:07.200
companies and you realize and and I love

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:08.799
taking this even further and in my book

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:10.080
I take it even further of how to find

00:04:08.799 --> 00:04:13.120
figure out where the great opportunities

